# Set Due Date from the command menu on an Overdue entry being edited returns to editing it when the prompt closes, so a typed x is text.
file <<END
- Aa @due({today-2})
- Bb @due({today-1})
END
keys gO <Enter> /
type set due
keys <Enter>
see Due date
type tomorrow
keys <Enter>
type x
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
- Aax @due({today+1})
- Bb @due({today-1})
END
